  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">the media program in armenia activity will work to strengthen the integrity of the information space in armenia by achieving the following objectives:   (1) enhance journalistic standards and content quality;  (2) catalyze the competitiveness and financial viability of public interest media; and   (3) foster enabling environment for independent information flow.</narrative>
  </description>
